       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFECT-SQUARE-CHECK.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-N PIC 99.
       01 WS-R PIC 99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-N FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL WS-N > 29
               COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION INTEGER(FUNCTION SQRT(WS-N) + 0.5)
               IF WS-R * WS-R = WS-N
                   DISPLAY WS-N
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
